# ANSYS FEA Model Exports

This folder contains **ANSYS-format FEA models** for ATA 53-00-04 (Design).

## Naming convention

Files MUST follow:

`53-00-04-ANLS-01x_RevX_*`

- `53-00-04` – ATA / design section identifier.
- `ANLS` – Analysis artifact.
- `01x` – FEA model code **(see mapping below)**.
- `RevX` – Model revision (e.g. `RevA`, `RevB`, or `Rev01`).
- `*` – Suffix describing content and/or format (e.g. `_Model.db`, `_Setup.wbpj`, `_Results.rst`).

### Example

- `53-00-04-ANLS-010_RevA_Model.db`
- `53-00-04-ANLS-010_RevA_Setup.wbpj`
- `53-00-04-ANLS-011_RevB_Model.db`

## 01x Code Mapping (example – adapt to your convention)

- `010` – Global fuselage FEA model.
- `011` – Door surround local model.
- `012` – Frame + skin local model.

Extend this list as needed and keep it in sync with your overall analysis coding scheme.

## Recommended file set per FEA model

For each `01x` and revision `RevX`, the recommended ANSYS files are:

- Primary model:
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-01x_RevX_Model.db`
- Optional:
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-01x_RevX_Setup.wbpj`
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-01x_RevX_Materials.xml`
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-01x_RevX_BC.xml`
  - `53-00-04-ANLS-01x_RevX_Results.rst` *(if tracked under Git LFS or referenced here)*

The **model database** (`.db`) and **workbench project** (`.wbpj`) are the authoritative, version-controlled artifacts in this folder.
